- 浏览器保存/恢复验证：在 Vite dev stub 环境中搜索 `setting.scroll.up`，改键为 `ctrl+shift+y` 后保存，确认 `setting.hotkeyOverrides["setting::ArrowUp:setting-scroll-up"]` 写入 `{ shortcutId: "ctrl+shift+y" }`；点击默认并再次保存后确认该 override 被删除，未捕获异常为 0；截图保存在 [../../../output/playwright/shortcut-settings-save-restore.png](../../../output/playwright/shortcut-settings-save-restore.png)。
