- 浏览器 When 保存/恢复验证：在 Vite dev stub 环境中搜索 `setting.tab.next`，通过“设置页”预设写入 `settingFocus && !inputFocus` 后保存，确认 `setting.hotkeyOverrides["setting::ArrowRight:setting-tab-next"]` 写入 `{ when: "settingFocus && !inputFocus" }`；点击默认并再次保存后确认该 override 被删除，未捕获异常为 0；截图保存在 [../../../output/playwright/shortcut-settings-when-save.png](../../../output/playwright/shortcut-settings-when-save.png)。
